# settings-pick-light (H1): Clean Teal picked with the system light. No stored
# picks (defaults), so the resolved scheme is the system's light; the click on
# the Clean Teal row keeps it checked and the menu open.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme light
wait 2000
click 1383 48
wait 500
click 1251 226
wait 500
shot settings-pick-light
